OL,3,APalestinian couple and teenage daughter
OL,4,Awho died in water off Shoreham named by
OL,5,Apolice
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Palestinian couple and their teenage
OL,8,Fdaughter who died after entering the
OL,9,Fwater off Shoreham, West Sussex, are
OL,10,Fnamed by police
OL,12,FThey are Hassan El-Khawas, 55, Zeina
OL,13,FAlayn, 37, and 14-year-old Sara
OL,14,FEl-Khawas
OL,16,FEl-Khawas was earlier identified as a
OL,17,FPalestinian refugee by the Palestinian
OL,18,Fembassy in London
OL,20,FAnother relation, a young girl, remains
OL,21,Fin critical condition in hospital
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
